BT 1 0 0 1 0 65 Tm /F1 10 Tf 15 TL (Long before the volcano cast its graceful conical shadow across the fertile plains of Albay, there lived in the) Tj T* (kingdom of Ibalon a chieftain named Makusog. His only daughter was Daragang Magayon, renowned across) Tj T* (the islands for both her peerless beauty and the gentle compassion she extended to all living creatures. Suitors) Tj T* (from distant provinces traveled across treacherous seas to seek her favor, including the haughty and) Tj T* (aggressive warrior Pagtuga, who amassed gold and hunting trophies to purchase her affection.) Tj T* ET
