BT 1 0 0 1 0 65 Tm /F1 10 Tf 15 TL (One morning while bathing in the rushing Yawa River, Magayon slipped on a moss-covered boulder and fell) Tj T* (into the swirling rapids. Hearing her cries, an honorable young warrior named Ulap\227son of a respected leader) Tj T* (from Laguna\227plunged into the torrent and carried her safely ashore. Their chance encounter ignited a deep) Tj T* -0.113571 Tw (and enduring devotion built upon mutual admiration and dignity. Makusog blessed their intended union, bringing) Tj T* 0 Tw (joy across the realm.) Tj T* ET
