BT 1 0 0 1 0 65 Tm 15 TL /F1 10 Tf .2 .254902 .333333 rg (Filipino cultural philosophers see in the bamboo the defining attribute of our national soul:) Tj T* /F3 10 Tf (katatagan) Tj /F1 10 Tf (\227resilience. Throughout centuries marked by natural calamities, economic hardships, and historic) Tj T* (struggles, the Filipino spirit has never broken. Instead of succumbing to despair, our people adapt with) Tj T* (optimism, warmth, and faith. True strength is not measured by rigid pride, but by the humble flexibility that) Tj T* (allows one to endure adversity without surrendering dignity.) Tj T* ET
